graph TD
  A[bad answer] --> B{is the doc in the index at all?}
  B -->|no| C[stages 1-2: source or parse]
  B -->|yes| D{does search return it?}
  D -->|no| E[stages 3-6: chunk, embed, filter, retrieve]
  D -->|yes| F{is it in the assembled context?}
  F -->|no| G[stage 7: ranking or top-n cutoff]
  F -->|yes| H{did the model use it?}
  H -->|no| I[stage 8-9: placement or generation]
  H -->|yes| J[stage 10: content itself is stale or wrong]

graph TD
  F[bad answer] --> R{is a relevant passage in the retrieved set?}
  R -->|no| RET[retrieval failure · check recall@k, then chunking, embedding, filters]
  R -->|yes| G{is the answer supported by that passage?}
  G -->|no| GEN[generation failure · groundedness · check placement and prompt]
  G -->|yes| A{does the answer address the question?}
  A -->|no| REL[relevance failure · check query understanding]
  A -->|yes| CON[content failure · the source itself is wrong or stale]

graph TD
  T[task] --> Q{is the sequence of steps knowable in advance?}
  Q -->|yes| W[workflow · code owns the sequence · each step a narrow LLM call]
  Q -->|no, depends on findings| A{are the tools good enough?}
  A -->|no| TD[fix tool design first · agt-02]
  A -->|yes| AG[agent loop · with budgets and gates]

graph TD
  T[task] --> V{multi-step dependent inference?}
  V -->|no| D[direct answer · level 1]
  V -->|yes| S{high stakes or verifiable domain?}
  S -->|no| C[elicited CoT or default reasoning · level 2-3]
  S -->|yes| H{is verification cheap?}
  H -->|yes| SC[reasoning model plus self-consistency · level 4]
  H -->|no| R[reasoning model with effort tuned by eval · level 3]

graph TD
  S{single agent struggling?} -->|no| ONE[keep single loop]
  S -->|yes| T{is it a tool-design problem?}
  T -->|likely| TD[fix tools first · agt-02]
  T -->|no| K{is the sequence knowable?}
  K -->|yes| WF[workflow · code owns sequence]
  K -->|no| W{named win: context isolation or parallelism?}
  W -->|no| SC[single loop with scoped catalogs and better state]
  W -->|yes| OW[orchestrator-worker with typed handoffs]

graph TD
  W{who is waiting?} -->|a person, now| S{P95 under ~10s?}
  S -->|yes| SYNC[sync gateway service · streamed]
  S -->|no| ASYNC[async queue worker · job id plus polling]
  W -->|a person, later| ASYNC
  W -->|nobody · data arrived| EV[event-driven pipeline · batch tier]
  ASYNC --> AG{multi-step with gates or long horizon?}
  AG -->|yes| JOB[agent runtime · durable, checkpointed, resumable]
  SYNC --> R{expensive derived state?}
  R -->|yes| SPLIT[add split ingestion/query path]

graph TD
  A[Customization need identified] --> B{Prompting/few-shot<br/>exhausted?}
  B -->|Not yet| C[Iterate on prompt + examples]
  B -->|Exhausted, gap remains| D{Is the gap missing/<br/>changing knowledge?}
  D -->|Yes| E[RAG]
  D -->|No — it's format/style/<br/>behavior despite knowing| F{RAG also<br/>insufficient?}
  E --> F
  F -->|Yes, behavior gap persists| G[Fine-tuning]
  F -->|No| H[Stay on cheaper rung]

graph TD
  A[General-purpose large model] --> B{Distillation:<br/>narrow the task}
  B --> C[Task-specific smaller model]
  C --> D{Quantization:<br/>reduce precision}
  D --> E[Edge-deployable artifact]
  F[Platform model on the device<br/>vendor-distilled and quantized] -.alternative path:<br/>call it through OS APIs.-> E
